@startuml
!include ../iris-style.puml
skinparam LineType ortho
title D-20  Workflow core classes (the thesis contribution)
caption Models from backend/apps/records and backend/apps/reviews; operations are the service functions in reviews/routing.py, seats.py, revisions.py, new_version.py, decisions.py, office_review.py and records/embargo.py on main (IR-1021).
show methods

class Record {
  pipeline_status
  record_type → RecordType
  adviser → User
  origin
  embargoed_until, embargo_released_at
  --
  set_embargo() / release_embargo()
}
class RecordVersion {
  number
  manuscript
  manuscript_sha256
  review_text → ReviewText
  --
  submit_new_version()
}
class RecordAssignment {
  party
  state
  due_at
  opened_at / closed_at
  --
  accept_and_route()
  route()
}
class ReviewerSeat {
  reviewer → User
  state
  source
  assigned_at / opened_at / done_at
  --
  claim() / assign() / reassign()
  open_review() / complete_seat()
}
class RecordClearance {
  office
  status
  comment
  reviewed_by → User
  --
  is_preserved()
  carryover()
}
class ResubmissionRequest {
  party
  state
  reason
  --
  request_revision()
  withdraw_revision_request()
}
class Review {
  stage
  status
  comment
  version → RecordVersion
  --
  record_office_review()
  decide()
}
class ReviewComment {
  severity (Must fix, Suggestion)
  is_draft
  anchor_version
}
class RoutingEvent {
  from_party
  to_party
  suggested_offices
}

Record "1" *-- "1..*" RecordVersion
Record "1" *-- "0..*" RecordAssignment
RecordAssignment "1" *-- "0..*" ReviewerSeat
Record "1" *-- "0..*" RecordClearance
Record "1" *-- "0..*" ResubmissionRequest
ResubmissionRequest "0..*" --> "1" RecordAssignment
RecordAssignment "1" o-- "0..*" Review
Review "0..*" --> "1" RecordVersion : reviewed against
Record "1" *-- "0..*" ReviewComment
Record "1" *-- "0..*" RoutingEvent

note right of RecordClearance
  Clearance-aware resubmission (ADR-003):
  a new Version resets only the clearance
  of the office whose ResubmissionRequest
  it answers; the others are preserved.
  RESUBMISSION_POLICY=restart_all is the
  comparison arm (ADR-004).
end note
@enduml
